  "title": "Adtran wins two FTTH Innovation Awards for AI‑driven network operations and home Wi‑Fi",
  "summary": "Adtran today announced two wins at the FTTH Innovation Awards 2026, recognizing its leadership across in-home connectivity and AI‑driven network operations. The company received awards in the categories for ‘Active infrastructure – home network’ and ‘Artificial intelligence (AI), machine learning and other software.’",
